		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=6997#p6997"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>quelque chose comme :</p><p>select distinct A.user_id FROM matable A WHERE NOT EXISTS ( SELECT 1 FROM matable B WHERE A.user_id = B.user_id AND B.goup_id IN (1,2))</p><p>ça devrait le faire.</p>]]></content>
